+ FilePreview is Box

+ content FilePreviewContent
+ preview-message = preview-content-message(#content)
+ preview-message-detail = preview-content-message-detail(#content)
+ title = preview-content-title(#content, region.#virtual-extent-y)
+ event open-requests Path
+ event refresh-requests Path
+ event close-requests Bool
+ event closed FilePreviewCloseEvent

